extends RefCounted
## GAMEPLAY stream game contract (MP2-DESIGN 10.7): every game member the
## extensions in extensions/gameplay/ override, and every member the gameplay
## modules and adapters read, write or call. Same format as
## loader/core/contract.gd ("feature|target|kind|member"); checked at boot with
## api.contract_check and by tools/contract_check.py against decomp/. Any missing
## member disables multiplayer as a whole (MP1 section 11).
## Features: mp2.sinks (4.2, 4.3), mp2.machines (4.4-4.6), mp2.interact (1.1, 6.x),
## mp2.combo (6.9).
## Metas used as protocol (not checkable): consumed, pending_maw_recycle,
## in_cannon_barrel, in_vacuum_bag, golf_aim_mode, orbit_in_orbit; ours:
## pitt_mp_press_stroke, pitt_mp_ritual, pitt_mp_ghost_peer, pitt_mp_rig_peer,
## pitt_mp_pin_gen, pitt_mp_pin_keys. Groups: terminal_pull, player, maw_inert.

